@startuml guest-to-cockpit
!include ../diagram-style.puml
' docs/architecture.md §6.1: from guest to cockpit.
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "Web app" as W
participant "UserContextGuard" as G
participant "InterviewController" as I
participant "CockpitController" as C
participant "@steuereule/core" as K

U -> W : opens the app
W -> I : POST /v1/steuerjahre/:jahr/interview/antworten
I -> G : canActivate
note over G : no session cookie, no guest cookie:\nnew guest id, signed cookie se_guest_session
I -> K : isValidAnswer, nextStepFor
I --> W : next step, open items
W -> C : GET /v1/steuerjahre/:jahr/cockpit
C -> K : cockpitRangeFromInputs
C --> W : refund range, open items
@enduml
